Maas, Hannun & Ng, "Rectifier Nonlinearities Improve Neural Network Acoustic Models" (ICML 2013 workshop): the Leaky ReLU origin — four pages, small speech task, every hyperparameter present. The anti-mill specimen in one object: workshop venue, tiny scale, complete specification, no acronyms. [High confidence.] Alongside: Glorot & Bengio 2010 (AISTATS, initializatioPn), Nair & Hinton 2010 (ReLU, ICML), He et al., "Delving Deep into Rectifiers" (ICCV 2015 — ReLU and init, unusually well-specified for a proposal paper). [All high confidence.]

